WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:10.380 --> 00:00:11.680
I promise you.

00:00:12.100 --> 00:00:15.360
If I could be a different person, I would.

00:00:17.160 --> 00:00:20.800
Not because I want it, but because they do.

00:00:23.300 --> 00:00:24.680
But here's the thing.

00:00:24.800 --> 00:00:28.020
One day, I just showed up without a map or a compass,

00:00:28.300 --> 00:00:32.100
and at some point, you have to make a choice...

00:00:34.720 --> 00:00:37.240
... about who you are...

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:39.700
and what you want.

00:00:41.640 --> 00:00:43.640
And therein lies the catch.

